message: "If you use BANLAG, please cite it as below."
title: "BANLAG: Auditing AI Search Against India's Drug Regulations"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The BANLAG authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aishwaryadewangan15-wq/banlag"
license: MIT
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-10"
keywords:
  - SerpApi
  - AI Overview
  - citation audit
  - fixed-dose combinations
  - India
  - drug regulation
abstract: >-
  BANLAG is a local-first research workbench. It connects captured Google AI Overview
  answers to their citation metadata and to the exact formulations in India's June 2026
  Section 26A fixed-dose-combination notifications, keeping mechanical observations
  separate from experimental parser interpretation.
